How to Reproduce
Download a database script or SQLite database file from the Chinook repository.
Create or open the database using the instructions for your chosen SQL engine.
Run the SQL scripts in the sql/ folder.
Validate totals and rankings against the source tables, taking care not to double-count invoice totals when joining invoices to invoice lines.
Add the final query outputs or charts to results/, then update Key Findings with the actual figures and a brief interpretation.
